      The extension enumeration defines SBI_HART_EXT_SMEPMP (line 32), SBI_HART_EXT_ZKR (line 45), SBI_HART_EXT_SMNPM (line 71), and SBI_HART_EXT_ZICFILP (line 73), but SBI_HART_EXT_SMMPM is absent. No enumeration constant exists, so no code can query 'is Smmpm implemented?' This is the structural precondition for the gap at sbi_hart_ext[] — without the enum constant, even a hypothetical check for Smmpm cannot be written.
